,"text":"யர்","tr":"yar"}]},{"text":"தண்கட","tr":"taṇkaṭa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தண்","tr":"taṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கட","tr":"kaṭa"}]},{"text":"னாட்டே","tr":"ṉāṭṭē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னாட்","tr":"ṉāṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டே","tr":"ṭē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வீழ்","parts":[{"text":"வீழ்","lemma":"வீழ்","gloss":"aerial root"}],"gloss":"aerial root"},{"surface":"தாழ்","parts":[{"text":"தாழ்","lemma":"தாழ்","gloss":"hanging low"}],"gloss":"hanging low"},{"surface":"தாழை","parts":[{"text":"தாழை","lemma":"தாழை","gloss":"screw-pine"}],"gloss":"screw-pine"},{"surface":"ஊழ்","parts":[{"text":"ஊழ்","lemma":"ஊழ்","gloss":"maturity"}],"gloss":"maturity"},{"surface":"உறு","parts":[{"text":"உறு","lemma":"உறு","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"கொழு","parts":[{"text":"கொழு","lemma":"கொழு","gloss":"thick"}],"gloss":"thick"},{"surface":"முகை","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"bud"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குருகு","parts":[{"text":"குருகு","lemma":"குருகு","gloss":"heron"}],"gloss":"heron"},{"surface":"உளர்","parts":[{"text":"உளர்","lemma":"உளர்","gloss":"preening"}],"gloss":"preening"},{"surface":"இறகின்","parts":[{"text":"இறகு","lemma":"இறகு","gloss":"feather"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like the feathers"},{"surface":"விரிபு","parts":[{"text":"விரிபு","lemma":"விரி","gloss":"opening"}],"gloss":"opening"},{"surface":"தோடு","parts":[{"text":"தோடு","lemma":"தோடு","gloss":"petal"}],"gloss":"petal"},{"surface":"அவிழும்","parts":[{"text":"அவிழும்","lemma":"அவிழ்","gloss":"blooming"}],"gloss":"blooming"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seashore grove"}],"gloss":"seashore grove"},{"surface":"நண்ணிய","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணிய","lemma":"நண்ணு","gloss":"reached"}],"gloss":"reached"},{"surface":"சிறுகுடி","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"},{"text":"குடி","lemma":"குடி","gloss":"hamlet"}],"gloss":"small hamlet"},{"surface":"முன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"முன்றில்","lemma":"முன்றில்","gloss":"front yard"}],"gloss":"front yard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திரைவந்து","parts":[{"text":"திரைவந்து","lemma":"திரைவந்து","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெயரும்","parts":[{"text":"பெயரும்","lemma":"பெயரும்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்பநத்","parts":[{"text":"என்பநத்","lemma":"என்பநத்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துறந்து","parts":[{"text":"துறந்து","lemma":"துறந்து","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"நெடுஞ்சேண்","parts":[{"text":"நெடுஞ்சேண்","lemma":"நெடுஞ்சேண்","gloss":"very far distance"}],"gloss":"very far distance"},{"surface":"நாட்டார்","parts":[{"text":"நாட்டார்","lemma":"நாட்டார்","gloss":"he of the land"}],"gloss":"he of the land"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":"although"}],"gloss":"although"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நெஞ்சிற்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சிற்","lemma":"நெஞ்சிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கணியர்","parts":[{"text":"கணியர்","lemma":"கணியர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தண்கட","parts":[{"text":"தண்கட","lemma":"தண்கட","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"னாட்டே","parts":[{"text":"னாட்டே","lemma":"னாட்டே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Hanging-root-low screw-pine's mature thick bud / like a preening heron's feather expanding, its petals open / in the front yard of the small hamlet close to the seashore grove, / where waves come and return, they say, having abandoned us / though he is of a very far country, / he is close to the heart, in the cool sea land.","translation":"In the front yard of our small hamlet near the seashore grove, where waves come and go, the mature, thick buds of the screw-pine with low-hanging roots open their petals like the preening feathers of a heron. They say he has abandoned us and gone to a very distant land; yet, he of the cool sea land remains close to my heart.","modern":"விழுதுகள் தாழ்ந்த தாழையின் முதிர்ந்த பருத்த மொட்டு, நாரை தன் சிறகை விரிப்பது போல இதழ்கள் அவிழ்ந்து மலரும். கடற்கரைச் சோலையை அடுத்த நம் சிறு குடிலின் முற்றத்தில் அலைகள் வந்து வந்து மீளும். நம்மைத் துறந்து அவர் மிகத் தொலைதூர நாட்டிற்குச் சென்றுவிட்டார் என்று கூறுகிறார்கள். ஆயினும், குளிர்ந்த கடல் நாட்டை உடைய அவர் என் நெஞ்சிற்கு மிக நெருக்கமானவராகவே இருக்கிறார்.","explanation":"The heroine (thalaivi) is speaking to her friend (thōḻi) about the hero (thalaivaṉ) who has gone away to a distant land. Although others say he has abandoned her, she feels his constant presence in her heart. The poem is set in the Neytal (seashore) landscape, characterized by the screw-pine (tāḻai) blooming in the front yard of the coastal hamlet where waves constantly come and go. The image of the screw-pine bud opening like a heron preening its feathers evokes the beauty and intimacy of their coastal home. The coming and going of the waves symbolizes the constant flow of her thoughts of him, showing that despite the physical distance, he remains close to her heart.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}